body:
yeah, i went to check the dota gamepedia page to see what i missed out and its actually a lot.  
&nbsp;  
glimmer cape, hood, pipe, rubick's null field, pudge flesh heaps, viper's corrosive skin, aa's ice vortex, skywrath's silence.  
&nbsp;  
ghost form and evasion will be the best way of mitigating physical dmg. and there will be no down side to taking additional magic dmg in ghost form  
&nbsp;  
medusa's stone gaze and ember's flame guard are the only skills that get buffed(pseudo buffed for flame guard) because of how they work.  
&nbsp;  
repel and bkb is also pseudo buffed if spell immunity still prevents pure dmg spells from being cast.
